%% Source: frontend/src/components/AuthForm.tsx (handleOAuth), frontend/src/routes/__root.tsx (onAuthStateChange)
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Auth as AuthForm.tsx
    participant Supa as Supabase Auth
    participant Provider as GitHub / LinkedIn (linkedin_oidc) / Spotify
    participant Root as __root.tsx (onAuthStateChange)

    User->>Auth: click "Continue with GitHub/LinkedIn/Spotify"
    Auth->>Auth: track oauth_signin_started
    Auth->>Supa: auth.signInWithOAuth({ provider, redirectTo: "/home" })
    Supa->>Provider: redirect browser to provider consent screen
    User->>Provider: authenticate + approve
    Provider-->>Supa: OAuth callback with code/token
    Supa-->>Root: session established, fires SIGNED_IN
    Root->>Root: onAuthStateChange handles SIGNED_IN (telemetry, I18nProvider reload)
    Root-->>User: redirected to /home
    alt signInWithOAuth call itself fails (e.g. provider disabled)
        Supa-->>Auth: error
        Auth->>Auth: track oauth_signin_failed
        Auth-->>User: oauthSignInFailed toast
    end
